(name of it, "/api/site/" & (if (master site flag of it) then "master" else ((if (external site flag of it) then "external" else if (custom site flag of it) then "custom" else if (operator site flag of it) then "operator" else "<unknown>") & "/" & (concatenation "%2526" of substrings separated by "&" of concatenation "%253F" of substrings separated by "?" of concatenation "%2523" of substrings separated by "#" of concatenation "%2520" of substrings separated by " " of concatenation "%252F" of substrings separated by "/" of concatenation "%2525" of substrings separated by "%25" of name of it))) & "/files") of all bes sites whose (exists site files of it)
